{"unit_id": "040822__dsh-gzip#card-zh", "repo": "040822/dsh-gzip", "commit": "c240249aca74f91a458b233c523229803d671555", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-gzip 是面向旧版 DeepSeek Harness Web 的 gzip 压缩插件，可减少低带宽环境中的 API 响应传输量。它在 webServer 注册 /api 路由时包装处理器，并针对客户端接受 gzip 且响应为 JSON 或普通文本的情况压缩响应。它保留 SSE、zip 导出、已编码响应及未协商压缩的原样传输，并处理响应头、Vary 和写入背压。适合通过慢速或远程网络加载会话历史的用户；需要 Node.js 22.19 或更高版本，并仅支持 DSH 0.1.2-rc.1 之前声明的版本。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:150-164", "index.js:87-109"]}
{"unit_id": "040822__dsh-gzip#card-en", "repo": "040822/dsh-gzip", "commit": "c240249aca74f91a458b233c523229803d671555", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-gzip compresses older DSH Web /api responses to speed session history loading on slow links. It wraps the route handler and gzips accepted JSON or text responses; SSE, zip, and already encoded responses pass through. Requires Node.js 22.19 or newer; DSH 0.1.2-rc.1 and later are unsupported.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:150-164", "index.js:87-109"]}
