{"unit_id": "040822__dsh-gzip#feature-gzip-api", "repo": "040822/dsh-gzip", "commit": "c240249aca74f91a458b233c523229803d671555", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-gzip 的功能「压缩 /api 响应」：它在 DSH Web 注册 /api 路由时包装处理器；客户端接受 gzip 且响应为可压缩类型时，流式压缩响应体并设置编码响应头。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:150-161", "index.js:87-110"]}
